<title>AUSTRALIA: GOLF-FINAL VICTORIAN OPEN SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-FINAL VICTORIAN OPEN SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores after the final</p>
<p>round of the Victorian Open tournament at the par-72 Victorian</p>
<p>golf club on Sunday (Australian unless stated):</p>
